<font size="+2" color="#0000FF">赤い鳥</font><br>
<hr>
<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong>運営委員会</strong>  <i>2001/07/11 23:04:33</i><br></td>
